# GS23: from mia_joins (continue with vale_day1_continue.keys + --flash-in): the statue room's east side (over the statue),
# exit 10 to the waterfalls room, exit 12 up to MercuryLighthouseMiddle's pipe maze (7,29). The stair pipe pushed east to
# column 11 (raises the stairs: water jets at 11-13,38 / 22,42-44 / 16-18,49 carry the leader back, mercury_lighthouse.c
# MercuryLighthouse_WalkLeaderIn), through the jets to the east strip and the row-29 passage under the pipes, the pipe pushed
# back west from 12,32 (jets off), the passages under the pipes (rows 35, 45), the chest at 24,34; out by 9,52 to the gate
# room (two battles fled), the gate statue moved by Move (DOWN twice, from 13,15 and 14,14) and walk-pushed along row 16 and
# up column 5 onto the floor switch (5,13): the gate opens (FLAG_MERCURY_LIGHTHOUSE_GATE_HELD_OPEN); the ladder to 9,10,
# exit 1 down to the Lower's hole room (29,43); south into the hole (behavior 15, 29,37): the leader drops into the pool's
# heart in MercuryLighthouseEntrance (12,34), the inscription; B; north to 12,32; Mia's Ply on the Ply target
# (mercury_lighthouse_entrance.c MercuryLighthouseEntrance_ActivateWithPly): the room dims, sparks, the colours shimmer.
